# H1 `mcphttp`, ready on cue: a profile HTTP MCP server on the run's own
# loopback fixture, which holds every request at launch (the server is
# connecting) and then, on cue, answers the held initialize (ready, its one
# tool listed). `/mcp list` is fx c1db919's and xfx's menu and fx v0.0.16's
# table; Escape leaves either. The fixture's log has every frame each binary
# sent it.
mcphttp hang
fx: homefile .fx/mcp.json h1-mcp.json
xfx: homefile .xfx/mcp.json h1-mcp.json
wait 4
type /mcp list
key Enter
wait 1.5
snap hanging
key Escape
wait 0.5
mcphttp ready
wait 3
type /mcp list
key Enter
wait 1.5
snap ready
key Escape
wait 0.5
gwlog
